cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Artifice Transcribe"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, bring-your-own-model (BYOM) tool for oral history and
  interview transcription with speaker diarization, built on WhisperX and
  pyannote.audio. Transcripts are reviewed against synchronised audio, carry
  interview metadata, and export to archival formats such as OHMS and TEI.
  Recordings never leave the researcher's machine.
type: software
